cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Flux Engine in your research, benchmarks, or production systems, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Flux Engine"
version: "1.0.3"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/TheApathy/flux-engine"
url: "https://github.com/TheApathy/flux-engine"
authors:
  - name: "TheApathy"
abstract: >-
  Flux Engine is a native Rust and custom CUDA/PTX large language model inference
  runtime optimized for NVIDIA Grace Blackwell (GB10 SM121a), discrete Blackwell
  (SM120a / SM103a), and experimental Apple Metal targets, featuring native
  block-scaled NVFP4/MXFP8 Tensor Core kernels, Gated DeltaNet and Query-Sparse
  Attention, TurboQuant+ KV cache compression, and lossless multi-token
  speculative decoding.
keywords:
  - llm
  - inference
  - rust
  - cuda
  - blackwell
  - nvfp4
  - speculative-decoding
  - moe
  - kv-cache-quantization
